Here is a complete, lightweight, and modern web app designed specifically for a physiotherapy practice. 

It includes **patient management**, **visit history tracking**, and a **SOAP notes format** (Subjective, Objective, Assessment, Plan)—the standard used in physiotherapy documentation.

### How to use this:
1. Save the code below into a file named **`index.html`**.
2. Double-click the file to open it directly in any web browser (Chrome, Edge, Safari, Firefox).
3. **No installation or internet required.** All data is saved automatically to your browser's local storage.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>PhysioNotes - Clinical Documentation</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0d9488;
            --primary-hover: #0f766e;
            --bg: #f8fafc;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --text-main: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg); color: var(--text-main); display: flex; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }

        /* Sidebar: Patient List */
        #sidebar {
            width: 320px;
            background: var(--surface);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .sidebar-header { padding: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .sidebar-header h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .btn {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); }
        #patientList { list-style: none; overflow-y: auto; flex-grow: 1; }
        .patient-item {
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.15s;
        }
        .patient-item:hover { background-color: #f1f5f9; }
        .patient-item.active { background-color: #ccfbf1; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary); }
        .patient-name { font-weight: 600; }
        .patient-phone { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

        /* Main Workspace */
        #mainContent { flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow-y: auto; }
        .empty-state { margin: auto; text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); }

        /* Clinical Records View */
        #patientWorkspace { display: none; padding: 2rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }
        .workspace-header { margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 1rem; }

        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* SOAP Note Inputs */
        .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
        label { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; }
        textarea, input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.6rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 0.25rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 60px; }

        /* Note Feed */
        .timeline { margin-top: 2rem; }
        .note-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .note-date { font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .soap-field { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .soap-tag { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Sidebar: Patient Selection -->
    <div id="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-header">
            <h2>PhysioNotes</h2>
            <button class="btn" onclick="promptNewPatient()">+ New Patient</button>
        </div>
        <ul id="patientList"></ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <div id="mainContent">
        <div id="emptyView" class="empty-state">
            <h3>Select a patient or add a new one to get started.</h3>
        </div>

        <div id="patientWorkspace">
            <div class="workspace-header">
                <h1 id="viewPatientName">Patient Name</h1>
                <p id="viewPatientPhone" style="color: var(--text-muted);"></p>
            </div>

            <!-- New SOAP Note Form -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Record Visit Note (SOAP)</h3>
                <form id="noteForm" onsubmit="saveNote(event)">
                    <div class="form-grid">
                        <div>
                            <label>Subjective (Patient's reported symptoms, pain score)</label>
                            <textarea id="subInput" placeholder="e.g. Lower back pain 6/10, worse in mornings..." required></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label>Objective (ROM, palpation, special tests, posture)</label>
                            <textarea id="objInput" placeholder="e.g. Lumbar flexion limited by 50%, negative SLR..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label>Assessment (Diagnosis, treatment progress)</label>
                            <textarea id="assInput" placeholder="e.g. Lumbar facet arthropathy, improving mobility..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label>Plan (Interventions done today, home exercises)</label>
                            <textarea id="planInput" placeholder="e.g. Grade III mobilizations, prescribed bird-dog exercise..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn" style="margin-top: 1rem; width: auto;">Save Note</button>
                </form>
            </div>

            <!-- Previous Notes History -->
            <div class="timeline">
                <h3>Past Visits</h3>
                <div id="noteHistory" style="margin-top: 1rem;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Data Structure Stored in localStorage
        let patients = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('physio_patients')) || [];
        let activePatientId = null;

        function saveToStorage() {
            localStorage.setItem('physio_patients', JSON.stringify(patients));
        }

        function promptNewPatient() {
            const name = prompt("Enter Patient Full Name:");
            if (!name) return;
            const phone = prompt("Enter Phone Number (optional):") || "";

            const newPatient = {
                id: Date.now().toString(),
                name,
                phone,
                notes: []
            };

            patients.unshift(newPatient);
            saveToStorage();
            renderSidebar();
            selectPatient(newPatient.id);
        }

        function renderSidebar() {
            const list = document.getElementById('patientList');
            list.innerHTML = '';
            patients.forEach(p => {
                const li = document.createElement('li');
                li.className = `patient-item ${p.id === activePatientId ? 'active' : ''}`;
                li.onclick = () => selectPatient(p.id);
                li.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="patient-name">${p.name}</div>
                    <div class="patient-phone">${p.phone || 'No phone'}</div>
                `;
                list.appendChild(li);
            });
        }

        function selectPatient(id) {
            activePatientId = id;
            const patient = patients.find(p => p.id === id);

            document.getElementById('emptyView').style.display = 'none';
            document.getElementById('patientWorkspace').style.display = 'block';

            document.getElementById('viewPatientName').innerText = patient.name;
            document.getElementById('viewPatientPhone').innerText = patient.phone ? `Phone: ${patient.phone}` : '';

            renderSidebar();
            renderNotes(patient.notes);
        }

        function saveNote(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            const patient = patients.find(p => p.id === activePatientId);

            const newNote = {
                id: Date.now(),
                date: new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { weekday: 'short', year: 'numeric', month: 'short', day: 'numeric', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }),
                subjective: document.getElementById('subInput').value,
                objective: document.getElementById('objInput').value,
                assessment: document.getElementById('assInput').value,
                plan: document.getElementById('planInput').value
            };

            patient.notes.unshift(newNote); // Add newest on top
            saveToStorage();
            renderNotes(patient.notes);
            document.getElementById('noteForm').reset();
        }

        function renderNotes(notes) {
            const container = document.getElementById('noteHistory');
            container.innerHTML = '';

            if (notes.length === 0) {
                container.innerHTML = '<p style="color: var(--text-muted);">No records found for this patient.</p>';
                return;
            }

            notes.forEach(n => {
                const div = document.createElement('div');
                div.className = 'note-card';
                div.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="note-date">${n.date}</div>
                    <div class="soap-field"><span class="soap-tag">S:</span> ${n.subjective || '-'}</div>
                    <div class="soap-field"><span class="soap-tag">O:</span> ${n.objective || '-'}</div>
                    <div class="soap-field"><span class="soap-tag">A:</span> ${n.assessment || '-'}</div>
                    <div class="soap-field"><span class="soap-tag">P:</span> ${n.plan || '-'}</div>
                `;
                container.appendChild(div);
            });
        }

        // Initial render
        renderSidebar();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

### Features Built-in:
* **Physio-Tailored (SOAP Format):** Fields for *Subjective*, *Objective*, *Assessment*, and *Plan* ensure standard clinical notes.
* **Persistent Local Storage:** Closing the browser will not erase data; it is saved in your local web storage.
* **Chronological History:** All prior notes for a selected patient are listed with timestamps, showing the most recent visit first.
* **Zero Configuration:** Single file, clean modern interface, and runs offline on any desktop or tablet.

